title: Rubrik Node Hardware Health: General Information
agents: Rubrik
catalog: hw/storagehw/Rubrik
license: GPLv3
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the hardware health policies reported for individual Rubrik nodes.
 Healthy policies are {OK}; unhealthy policies are {CRIT} by default.
 The ruleset "Rubrik Node Hardware Health" provides a selection of known policy names
 for exceptions, for example {NETWORK_INTERFACE_CHECKER_PRIMARY}. An unhealthy policy
 can be ignored or evaluated as {OK}, {WARN}, or {CRIT}. Healthy policies remain {OK}.
 Ignored policies do not affect the service state. The worst state of the remaining
 policies determines the service state. If all returned policies are ignored,
 the service reports {OK} with an explicit summary. No returned policies results in {UNKNOWN}.
 Original findings and messages remain visible in the details, together with any
 configured ignore or state mapping. Duplicate policy names are not allowed in a rule.
 Policies not included in the selection are still monitored and remain {CRIT} when unhealthy.
inventory:
 One service is created per node.
